false}},{"id":4301481383,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQzMDE0ODEzODM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/events/4301481383","actor":{"login":"eps1lon","id":12292047,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjkyMDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12292047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon","html_url":"https://github.com/eps1lon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-02-08T06:00:02Z","label":{"name":"Component: ESLint Rules","color":"f7afdb"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":4301481384,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQzMDE0ODEzODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/events/4301481384","actor":{"login":"eps1lon","id":12292047,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjkyMDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12292047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon","html_url":"https://github.com/eps1lon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eps1lon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-02-08T06:00:02Z","label":{"name":"Type: Bug","color":"b60205"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/775449674","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react/issues/20750#issuecomment-775449674","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/20750","id":775449674,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3NTQ0OTY3NA==","user":{"login":"0x24a537r9","id":3403450,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDM0NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3403450?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9","html_url":"https://github.com/0x24a537r9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-08T20:48:15Z","updated_at":"2021-02-08T20:48:15Z","body":"Heh, a fair question. In my case, I needed it in order to support generics for a hook that helps manage state for asynchronous calls like mutations:\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport function useAsyncAction<F extends (...args: unknown[]) => Promise<R>, R>(\r\n  doAction: F,\r\n): [\r\n  doActionWithState: F,\r\n  isDoingAction: boolean,\r\n  errorDoingAction: unknown | null,\r\n  clearErrorDoingAction: () => void,\r\n] {\r\n  const [isDoingAction, setIsDoingAction] = useState<boolean>(false);\r\n  const [errorDoingAction, setErrorDoingAction] = useState<unknown | null>(null);\r\n\r\n  // https://github.com/facebook/react/issues/20750\r\n  // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps\r\n  const doActionWithState = useCallback(\r\n    (async (...args: unknown[]): Promise<R> => {\r\n      setIsDoingAction((prevIsDoingAction) => {\r\n        if (prevIsDoingAction) {\r\n          throw new ReentrancyError(doAction);\r\n        }\r\n        return true;\r\n      });\r\n      setErrorDoingAction(null);\r\n\r\n      try {\r\n        return await doAction(...args);\r\n      } catch (e: unknown) {\r\n        setErrorDoingAction(e);\r\n        throw e;\r\n      } finally {\r\n        setIsDoingAction(false);\r\n      }\r\n    }) as F,\r\n    [doAction],\r\n  );\r\n\r\n  const clearErrorDoingAction = useCallback(() => setErrorDoingAction(null), []);\r\n\r\n  return [doActionWithState, isDoingAction, errorDoingAction, clearErrorDoingAction];\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWithout the cast, TS doesn't know that the shape of the args object is the same. On the return statement, TS warns:\r\n\r\n```\r\nType '(...args: unknown[]) => Promise<R>' is not assignable to type 'F'.\r\n  '(...args: unknown[]) => Promise<R>' is assignable to the constraint of type 'F', but 'F' could be instantiated with a different subtype of constraint '(...args: unknown[]) => Promise<R>'.ts(2322)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis remains true even if I make the args a generic type too, so I think the issue is unavoidable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/775449674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"0x24a537r9","id":3403450,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDM0NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3403450?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9","html_url":"https://github.com/0x24a537r9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0x24a537r9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/813187758","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react/issues/20750#issuecomment-813187758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/20750","id":813187758,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxMzE4Nzc1OA==","user":{"login":"Shrugsy","id":22929669,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI5NjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22929669?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy","html_url":"https://github.com/Shrugsy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-05T05:13:47Z","updated_at":"2021-04-05T05:13:47Z","body":"@0x24a537r9 TS is correct there. A function that has the same input type & return type as `F` is not assignable to `F`. `F` might have other properties attached to it as well, which won't be attached to `doActionWithState`.\r\n\r\nFor your particular situation, the type for `doActionWithState` can be a function that has the same argument & return types as `F`, but should not be `F`. Casting it as `F` is lying to typescript.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/813187758/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Shrugsy","id":22929669,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI5NjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22929669?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy","html_url":"https://github.com/Shrugsy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shrugsy/received_events","type":"User","user_vie